    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview / Indulgence in the Dark Corners of the Internet</strong><br> \u00a0Your one night stand turns out to be a semi famous cosplayer from a few years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide to do something for your yandere girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch a fan support platform, build her fanbase, and of course, don\u2019t forget the spicy rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignore the harsh criticism. Forget the judgmental stares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688290/extras/5c608969b7cef1ef57407ce2e105372d.avif?t=1754662427\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\uff02Just one more look\u2026 please?\uff02</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>H-Scenes That Satisfy Your Need for Psychological Dominance</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sweet romantic sex to desperate clingy pleas, and even costumed roleplay\u2014indulge your deepest need to dominate, emotionally and physically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688290/extras/3fcd1a9e833a6460870830f4427cc7a9.avif?t=1754662427\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688290/extras/70339f1ffab8e521e95d5f3e5fac813f.avif?t=1754662427\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulation &amp; Management</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials, post content, engage with fans, and grow her popularity to rake in serious cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688290/extras/006b18da2adfe5ffa296bdde33582d95.avif?t=1754662427\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688290/extras/3d4058196cf45ef47122d3ce52063be7.avif?t=1754662427\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you run things safely and clean? Court controversy for fast fame? Or arrange private \u201cmeetups\u201d with sugar daddies? Your choices shape her future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688290/extras/94d1edb71ec6eb8fec5aee3edf3db60e.avif?t=1754662427\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
